NOTE — one bundled dependency is under a different license:
`org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder` (used by the built-in video player for extra audio
codecs such as AC-3/E-AC-3/DTS) is licensed under GPL-3.0, not MIT. Shipping a build that
includes it means that build, as a whole, must be distributed under terms compatible with
GPL-3.0 (source availability included). If you want to keep this entire project under plain
MIT terms, remove that one dependency line from `app/build.gradle.kts` and the related renderer
setup in `app/src/main/java/com/nhdeveloper/nhfiles/vpo/player/PlayerHolder.kt` — the video
player still works for all standard formats without it.
